# Allowlist: nothing enters the build context unless it is listed here, so
# untracked local files (working docs, .git, .env, editor and tool folders)
# never reach the image, whatever they are called.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps
!packages

# Build output and local artefacts inside the allowed folders.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dev-dist
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.env*
